# Root .gitignore for ALMED AHU project

# Gradle cache directories (should never be committed)
**/gradle/caches/
**/gradle/wrapper/dists/
**/${GRADLE_USER_HOME}/
**/GRADLE_USER_HOME/
**/.gradle/
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/

# Android build artifacts
**/android/app/build/
**/android/build/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties
**/*.iml

# Flutter
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/

# Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.Python
**/venv/
**/env/
**/.venv

# IDE
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.DS_Store

# OS
**/Thumbs.db
**/.DS_Store

